#X text 20 10 Every LIF spike (a single sample of 1.0) rings a [vcf~] bandpass with Q = 40 (sharp). Every Izhikevich spike rings [bob~] \, a Moog-style ladder filter at resonance 3.9 (just below self-oscillation) - the same trick as the original NeuralNetwork patch. The Izhikevich membrane voltage itself is audible when the neuron runs fast (speed > 10000)., f 140;
